---
description: Frontend rules for the Vite app
globs: web/**
alwaysApply: false
---

`web/` is UI only.

- React Aria Components and CSS Modules. No Tailwind.
- TypeScript `strict` stays on.
- All data access goes through the Supabase client in `src/lib/supabase.ts` and row-level security. Do not put a secret or service-role key in the frontend.
- Do not edit `supabase/` from a frontend task.
